## 5. Assumptions, constraints, and dependencies

### 5.1 Assumptions

Users registration followed accepted format and symbols.

Users log-in enter no more than 3 times incorrect information.

Users implement correctly following the user guide.

There are limited users using the platform.  

The client requires only text messaging 

Groups have a small number of members (around 10 users). 

### 5.2 Constraints

The Messenger application finished and committed to the repository no later than November 2. 

All work must be committed and pushed to GitHub. 

​

### 5.3 Dependencies

Access to the course GitHub repository to commit and push projects.

Database resources  

A working environment to implement the project (Node.js, etc.)

